 and  actually see their face which wasn't  something that we were able to do  maybe 10 years back and so i think this  has helped me  definitely have a greater appreciation  of it  but it doesn't make me feel like i need  to stop using technology i think if  anything it has really helped me to  realize that i need to be aware of how i  use it  when i'm using it am i using it to my  advantage to better my health my  relationships those of the people around  me my hope with all of this is that you  will also join on a technology fast  whether that be quitting video games for  a week or going without your phone for a  weekend or maybe just something simple  like for example  no answering phone calls or text  messages or touching the phone during  meal times that's something that my  husband and i have actually done ever  since we got married and i love that it  kind of makes it feel like we're still  on a date and i think it also respects  family time  so much more that way so it could be  something simple but one tip that i  would have for you if you are going to  have an extended technology fast is to  be very cautious and make sure that you  have some sort of a support because some  of us  have emotional struggles that we're  suppressing through the use of  technology and when all of a sudden you  don't have technology you're just left  with you and your thoughts and your  thoughts may not necessarily be positive  helpful ones um you know what i mean if  if you've had this experience  and so just have somebody that you can  go to because it's similar to a  workaholic for example that has lots of  problems in their family and they go to  work all the time to escape having to  deal with those problems well then  they're on vacation and what do they do  they bicker with their family or do they  actually work through problems so this  could be similar situation have somebody  that you can go to or a way that you can  process through these feelings that may  arise for example if you start to feel  lonely and even better if you could have  somebody that could kind of hold you  accountable and encourage you along the  way so hopefully you can go on a  technology fast of your own and let me  know what it will be i hope that this  challenge was of some value to you if so  please give it a thumbs up and help  support my channel and subscribe so that  you won't miss out on my future videos  and let me know what challenge you are  going to take on until next time bye
 

